<title>USA: Kansas feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</title>
<headline>Kansas feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DODGE CITY 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said trade was quiet late Monday. There were no sales of slaughter steers or heifers confirmed at the close.</p>
<p>Inquiry was moderate, demand was light.  Sales confirmed for the week to date on 600 cattle.  Bids not well established, few 66.00, asking 68.00-70.00.  Last price Thurs.</p>
<p>April 24 at 67.00.</p>
<p>confirmed: none	week ago: none	year ago: none</p>
<p>week to date: 600    week ago: 1500	week to date: 2000</p>
